    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77809" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραβλώψ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶπος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>looking askance, squinting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραβλῶπές τ᾽ ὀφθαλμώ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.503
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.361
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Autom.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὀφθαλμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Ind.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			; of a person, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				325
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Λιταί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Corn.
					<u>ND</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>blind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLond.
				1821.265
			</span></i>. (From <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραβλέπω</span>, as
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλώψ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλέπτω</span>.)</div>
